WEBVTT

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:48.230
Cocona Plain, Southern Central Flonyald

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.730
Godwin, are the troops advancing as planned?

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.730
Yes, Princess Leonmichelli.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:09.070
Unfortunately it's raining at the moment...

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.340
...but all our troops should reach the target

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.560
fortress by noon tomorrow.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:14.570
Just as you had ordered,

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.010
our troops are
being given ample food and rest...

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:20.990
...in preparation for
tomorrow's attack on the fortress.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:22.420
Hmm...

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.810
Tomorrow we shall once again show the Dog

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:39.600
Filianno Castle, Biscotti Republic

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.750
It looks like the Galette Lion Army will be

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.920
attacking Mion Fortress, just as we expected.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.150
The Galette Lion Army...

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.780
Are they seriously thinking of
advancing to this castle?

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:01.620
Princess Leonmichelli of the
Galette Lion Army is surely valiant...

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.420
...but I don't remember her being so reckless...

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.040
Whatever the reason...

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.040
We've been losing the past few battles...

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:15.300
If only we had Lord Dalkian or Tenko-sama.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:20.140
Knight Brioche and Yukikaze have
their own missions.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:23.460
That said, if we fail in this battle,

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:26.640
at the worst, we shall lose Filianno Castle...

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.020
That...

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.320
I won't allow that!

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:32.870
For our beloved princess and for the
people of Biscotti!

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.490
We must win this battle!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:35.450
Eclair.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.400
You are in her highness's presence.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.660
Excuse me...

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.380
Thank you, everyone.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:48.080
I understand the difficult position
the Biscotti Republic is now in.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:52.580
This battle is one we cannot afford to lose.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:56.590
So I think we should use
our last remaining card.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.640
In the name of Millefiore Filianno Biscotti…

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:06.050
...the leader of the Biscotti Republic...

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.520
I will summon a hero to this Republic!

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.570
Kinokawa City, Japan

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.570
Sink!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.070
Sink! Are you up?

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.840
Uh, yeah! I'm up!

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:33.690
Well hurry down then!

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.860
If we're gonna be late I'm leaving without you!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.050
Wait up, I'll be right there!

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.970
Morning, Becky.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.020
Morning, Sink.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:12.750
Okay, well done!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:20.260
Oh, y'know spring break starts tomorrow...

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.930
Are you going anywhere, Sink?

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:27.680
Uhh, my parents are away on
business trips as usual.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:30.940
So I'm thinking of going back home.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:34.060
Back home? You mean to Britain?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.540
Yeah, to Cornwall.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.060
There are a lot of places I can practice there.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:44.320
Sink, you really like athletics don't you?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.290
Well, sure. It's a lot of fun.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.630
We have a tournament in July and September,

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:00.050
"Iron Athletics", right?

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.470
Right. We have qualifiers in July
 and the main event in September.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:05.590
You were so close last year.

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.990
One more win, and you would have been the champion...

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.260
I know...

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.100
and you came to cheer me on and everything...

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:15.810
Well, I still think second place is
pretty amazing.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.100
But I really want to win first place this year!

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:22.110
So, during spring break
I'm going to practice like crazy!!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.900
Yeah, yeah... good luck!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.290
Oh, yeah, I forgot...

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.200
What?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.800
The last three days of spring break,

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:39.080
do you think you and your parents are free?

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.840
Hmm, I don't know... Why?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.850
My parents are coming back,
so they wondered...

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.710
...if you guys want to
come with us to

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:47.590
our house in Wakayama.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.350
Oh, really?

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.560
Yeah, they said Nanami's coming too.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.100
Wow, that sounds great!

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.570
It's the perfect time
to see the cherry blossoms...

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.700
...so if your parents are busy,

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.730
Really?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.090
But don’t you go leaving me

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.090
by myself
like you did before...

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.620
...while you go messing around with

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.620
your athletics and your stick fighting...

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.300
Don't worry!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.450
I'll work my myself to the bone before that!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:17.050
Don't go too crazy with your training...

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:21.960
Okay then, Becky!
Let me know if you can come!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.890
Okay! I'll send you an email.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:33.470
<i>Ahh, was your school life this year fulfilling?</i>

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.190
<i>Though you may have been born in
different countries..</i>

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.210
<i>...you all share the time you spend in Japan</i>

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.970
<i>
and your memories with your friends...</i>

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:44.480
<i>Spring break starts tomorrow, and...</i>

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.240
Huh? Izumi, what's wrong?
Are you leaving early?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.900
I'm sorry! I have to catch a plane!

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.990
Oh I see. Take care!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.630
Okay!

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.390
I think Japan is a good country.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:18.860
Especially Kinokawa City...
it's peaceful and convenient.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.980
But there aren't many places
where you can run around and play...

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.470
It's a bit crowded and boring.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.430
I wish there was someplace nearby...

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.910
...someplace where I could run wild.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.610
Huh? What?

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:19.130
Ouch...

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.650
A girl?

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:34.650
Uh, with big, furry ears and a tail?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.300
It's nice to meet you!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:40.160
You must be the Hero
who responded to my summons.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:41.910
Hero...

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:46.210
I summoned you, our Hero...

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.390
I am Millefiore  Filianno Biscotti,

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.010
Princess of Biscotti Republic...

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:55.170
...in the Filianno territory.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:58.670
Oh, right. I'm Sink Izumi.

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.440
You are the Hero, Sink-sama.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.300
Woof, woof!

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.930
Tatsumaki, good job bringing our hero here!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.270
Umm... wait a minute...

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:15.240
Our hero...

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.180
...thank you so much for responding

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:21.280
to my summons and coming to Flonyald.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.960
Please listen to our story...

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:28.830
Then, will you lend us a hand?

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:33.460
Uh... I'd like to hear
what you have to say first.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:34.760
Of course!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.190
Oh no! It has already begun!

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:42.630
It's begun?

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.970
Our Republic, Biscotti is now at war

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.400
The attack on the fortress is going well.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.350
The gate has opened.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:27.180
Good.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.330
We'll advance from the gate of the fortress!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.220
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.400
Advance, troops!

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.720
Today we shall seize Filianno Castle and

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:37.290
make the Dog Princess and her knights cry!

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.140
A bird?

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:53.380
Is this the first time you've seen a Cellkull?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.770
I'm sorry.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.960
This is my Cellkull, Harlan.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.790
Please climb on!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:10.180
We have fought our neighboring country

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.190
And recently we have been losing battles...

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:19.190
They have broken through
many fortresses and battlefields.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:23.190
And in today's battle,
they just might seize our castle.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.980
There is no one in our country

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.820
...leader of the Galette Lion Knights

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:31.700
and the knight of the King of Animals...

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.710
That is why we need your help!

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:39.930
Umm... I'm not a warrior or a hero.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.530
I'm just an ordinary middle school student...

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.340
Is there really anything I could do to help?

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.050
Oh you are being too modest!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:51.050
I know all about your powers!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:07.110
Things are burning hot here today
as the heated battle continues...

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:10.490
I, Framboise Charle
from the Galette Lion Army Territory...

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.330
...will be giving a play by play of the battle.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.320
Here to comment are General Bernard...

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.260
Hello!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:20.440
And Princess Leonmichelli's aide, Violle-san.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:22.210
Hello!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:23.550
And now...

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.600
...the warriors of the Galette Lion Army

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.920
Having taken down Poporo Fortress in only 20 minutes,

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.970
the Lion warriors are taking on the...

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:36.890
...invincible wall that protects
the Biscotti Republic,

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.850
Filianno Lake Field!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.570
Even the Lion warriors who have experienced

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.820
many battles are having a hard time here.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:51.340
Once this point is breached,

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:54.200
there is nothing the Biscotti side can do.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.280
Hey, are you alright?

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.080
The Biscotti side is always quick to rescue

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.090
Right, Violle-san?

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:10.230
I hope they will keep trying as

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:12.470
many times as they can and not give up.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:15.100
The commander, Leonmichelli

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.000
She has commented that if any famous knights
from the Biscotti side appear...

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.760
...she will immediately
join the battle and defeat them.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.980
Umm... How promising!

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:31.360
Second wave, attack!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.200
Whoa... this doesn't look good!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.090
Is it now?

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.960
What are the Martinozzis doing?

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.500
The Galette Lion Army is advancing...

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.170
Biscotti's young knight...

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:54.090
…Eclair Martinozzi is fighting
off the wave of warriors!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.280
Hey, a few have gotten through!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.790
Oh no, Loran!

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:00.300
Well that was really close!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:03.050
Bonus points will be given to the six warriors

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.750
...but I would really like to give a

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.170
special bonus to the one that came so close.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:10.730
Did you hear that?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.730
The warriors on the frontline,
 you're getting a bonus!

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:15.170
Congratulations!

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.680
Meow!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:22.440
This is... a battle?

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:23.520
Yes.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.060
Is this the first time you saw a battlefield?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:30.060
Umm, do people die or get injured in this battle?

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.570
Most certainly not!

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:35.270
Battles are conducted under the Rule

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.980
...is conducted in a dignified manner!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:41.780
It is the responsibility of those
who hold battles...

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.890
...to make sure injuries
and accidents do not occur.

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.440
Of course, it is also one method used to

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.170
conduct negotiations between countries...

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:51.090
...so things can get heated sometimes...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.390
But the battles fought in Flonyald...

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.360
...are also an event for the

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:59.430
people to enjoy sports and competition in a healthy way.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.520
We've been losing our battles...

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:06.270
...so the people and knights of Biscotti

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:12.160
And what's worse,
if our castle is attacked...

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.170
...then all our people who have worked

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:16.170
so hard will be very shonbori.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.240
Shonbori?

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:19.240
Yes, shonbori.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.370
A battle in another realm...

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:28.340
This is just like the stuff in the

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:30.510
fantasy novels Becky's always reading.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.900
If I think about it calmly,
I know this could only be a dream...

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.600
Umm, Princess?

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.340
Yes!

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:42.350
Am I this country's hero?

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.090
Yes! We found you,

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:47.850
and I have no doubt that you are the one...

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.350
You are this country's hero!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:55.670
Okay... I will accept you summons

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:00.360
The Hero, Sink, will try his best!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.630
Thank you so much!

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.530
No, thank you!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.350
Then let's hurry back to the castle...

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:10.040
We have all your equipment
and weapons ready!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.540
Tatsumaki! Harlan!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.590
Let's go, Harlan!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:27.690
Well then, Hero-sama!

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.350
Yes, your highness!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.820
Whoaa! We're flying!!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:47.630
Yes, we're flying! Harlan is very good!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.690
Whether it's a dream or reality...

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.420
It would be a waste to leave such an

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.760
interesting place without having some fun!

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:06.390
The Princess is coming back with our hero!

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:10.890
Breaking news just in!

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.180
Princess Millefiore has used

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:15.250
"Summon a Hero" for this showdown!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.320
This is amazing!!

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.520
This is the first time I have ever seen a hero

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.820
arrive at a battlefield!

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.820
So, what's the Hero of Biscotti like?

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.200
Filianno Castle Maid Unit!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:30.960
Have the Hero's outfit
and weapons been prepared?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:31.800
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:35.290
Okay, as soon as the Hero arrives,

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.500
we shall have him changed in 30 seconds!

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.010
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:41.010
The Hero?

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:42.610
Really?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.260
Princess!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.260
Rico! I'm back!

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.150
Welcome back!

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.860
So the Hero really came?

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:54.520
Yes. He is our wonderful hero.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.500
The people of Biscotti and the people

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.500
of the Galette Lion Army Territories...

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.650
...thank you for waiting!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.660
Though we at Biscotti
have been losing many battles recently...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:10.410
...today we will put an end to such a sad state.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:14.040
Because a wonderful hero has arrived...

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.920
...to bring hope and victory
to the people of Biscotti!

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:29.790
Brilliant and spectacular...

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:50.880
Summoned by the Princess...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:54.620
Hero Sink has now arrived!!

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:57.090
Advent of a hero

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:32.800
Hero, welcome to Flonyard!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.410
Uh, Hero, are you alright?

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:36.040
I-I screwed up the landing...

00:23:35.330 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>The First battle!!</b>

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:39.430
U-uh, please tune in again next time.
